# Cursor Rules — Cafe Project

Primary source of truth: **`CLAUDE.md`** (repo root) — read it first, then `docs/` for details (architecture, data domains, routes, Supabase, conventions, deployment).

Skills: `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.

This is an agent-only project. If you learn something reusable, add it to `docs/LEARNINGS.md` — see `CLAUDE.md` → Self-Improvement.

Don't add project facts here — they belong in `CLAUDE.md`/`docs/` so nothing drifts out of sync.
